      "summary": "(PHB-2024 52) | Greatsword (Graze) • Graze. If your attack roll with a Greatsword misses a creature, you can deal damage to it equal to the ability modifier used to make the attack. This damage is the same type dealt by the Greatsword, and can only be increased by increasing the ability modifier."
